WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:10.800
Open Runtime Extensions (/extensions) to inspect shipped OCR defaults, upload a Unicode regional plate-rules.json override, and verify CUSTOM OVERRIDE.

2
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:24.133
Switch to Offline Maps (.pmtiles), name the layer Regional Port Corridor, and upload a PMTiles v3 regional archive.

3
00:00:24.173 --> 00:00:36.213
Open Map (/map) and select Offline: Regional Port Corridor to render regional corridor roads, waterways, and all 50 portal lane markers offline.

4
00:00:36.253 --> 00:00:47.445
Return to Runtime Extensions (/extensions) and click Reset to Shipped Default to restore SHIPPED DEFAULT ACTIVE.
